          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1172,
          "end": 1181
        },
        {
          "text": "Prevention of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1189,
          "end": 1242
        },
        {
          "text": "sections 376",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1247,
          "end": 1259
        },
        {
          "text": "376(2)(j)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1261,
          "end": 1270
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Penal Code, 1860",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1278,
          "end": 1301
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "5. The prayer in the petition is for issuance of directions to constitute the Medical Board so as to examine the health of the foetus and health of the victim and further for directions to carry out the procedure for medical termination of pregnancy pursuant to the Provisions of the Medical Termination of Pregnancy Act, 1971.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1304,
      "end": 1631,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Medical Termination of Pregnancy Act, 1971",
